      "widgets_values": [
        "A masterpiece artistic photograph:\n\n<Picture 1> is an image features two medical professionals, a woman and a man, standing side-by-side against a black background. The woman on the left has light brown hair parted down the middle, fair skin, and a neutral expression. She is wearing a white doctor's lab coat over a light grey collared shirt, with a stethoscope draped around her neck, and holds a grey tablet. The man on the right has dark brown hair, a neatly trimmed beard, and a serious facial expression. He is dressed in a white lab coat over a white dress shirt with a black tie, also with a stethoscope around his neck, and is holding a dark clipboard and a pen.\n\n<Picture 2> is a man with a prominent grey and black beard, mustache, and dark hair, wearing dark sunglasses. He is wearing a woven straw cowboy hat with a brown leather chin strap hanging down. His clothing is a simple, solid black short-sleeved t-shirt. He is shown from the chest up, looking towards the viewer against a bright, white, overexposed background.\n\ntwo male and female doctors wearing lab coats from <Picture 1> are interviewing the man from <Picture 2>, inside a museum that has dinosaur bones on display in the background. a beam of sunlight breaking through from high windows.\n\nThe lighting is golden and dreamlike, with bokeh blur, candlelight, dust particles in the air, and beams of sunlight, with rich saturated colors and high contrast, HDR.\n\nThe photo is shot at an angle, with the two doctors from <picture 1> either side of the man from <Picture 2> and all facing toward the camera. The quality is superb, 8k, maximum resolution. The composition is artistic, flawless, and stunningly beautiful.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nN/A\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
