      "widgets_values": [
        "# MarkDKBerry.com\n\nThis is for making single shot t2i images using Minimax H3 model.\n\n*This approach and workflow came from QuintForms (4090 24G / 64G) quintforms on discord.*\n\n## MODELS REQUIRED\n\n- you will need the VAE for single shot from here [https://huggingface.co/linjian257/minimax-h3-t1-image-vae-int8-convrot/tree/main](https://huggingface.co/linjian257/minimax-h3-t1-image-vae-int8-convrot/tree/main)\n\n- then use whatever Minimax Models you prefer.\n\n\n## TESTS:\n\n- I couldnt get it to use the ref images accurately, it didnt even try to get the character faces correct (with ref model)"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
